+(* Dune/Melange overlay for Jsont_base, forked from jsont v0.3.0
+   (https://github.com/dbuenzli/jsont, tag v0.3.0, pinned as the
+   vendor/json_codec/jsont submodule). Two changes from upstream:
+
+   1. Melange has no Bigarray module at all, so the Rbigarray1 module below (a
+      resizable Bigarray.Array1.t, used only by Jsont.bigarray/Array.bigarray_map,
+      which Tessera's schema never calls) is removed.
+
+   2. Type.Id.uid (used only as a Dict lookup key, see jsont.ml's
+      Dict.mem/add/find) derived its result from Obj.Extension_constructor.id
+      (Obj.Extension_constructor.of_val ...), which raises under Melange's
+      Obj (discovered via test/web_bridge_equivalence: any Jsont.Object.mem-based
+      *decode*, not just encode, exercises this). Replaced with a plain
+      monotonic counter stamped into the generated module at Id.make time --
+      see that module's own comment for why this preserves the same lookup
+      contract under every backend.
+
+   Everything else is the unmodified upstream file. *)
+
 (* These three things should really belong to String. *)
 
